<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<!--
    Sparkle appcast for Notch Lyrics.

    This file is the live update feed. It is served from

        https://raw.githubusercontent.com/huo241/notch-lyrics/main/updater/appcast.xml

    which is exactly what SUFeedURL in NotchLyrics/Info.plist points at, so no
    GitHub Pages setup is involved.

    Run scripts/release.sh to build a version and append an entry here; that
    script also signs each archive with this project's EdDSA key. The matching
    public key lives in NotchLyrics/Info.plist under SUPublicEDKey, and Sparkle
    verifies every download against it.

    Each enclosure URL points at an asset attached to the matching GitHub
    Release, so an entry must never be published before its archive exists.
-->
